{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dig deeper? The depths are calling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this relaxing and addictive <strong>idle mining game</strong>, your goal is simple: dig, upgrade, and descend into the endless depths of the earth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to break rocks, hire powerful miners, and unlock upgrades to boost your progress. Every tap brings you closer to uncovering the secrets hidden below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Progression</strong> \u2013 How deep can you go?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Miners</strong> \u2013 Recruit unique characters to maximize your digging power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click &amp; Idle Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Play actively or let your miners dig while you relax.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Enjoy smooth, colorful isometric 3D visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep digging, upgrading, and paving your way to the center of the Earth. Only the most determined miners will reach the core...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you uncover what lies beneath?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810540?t=1763417761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/ffa2524b177244c98019581d8b2ee9ac066398cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763417761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/5bb15e0354292b4bbb6bbe0779cbdeb68a36cb8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763417761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/5bb15e0354292b4bbb6bbe0779cbdeb68a36cb8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763417761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}